// WHY: terminal UI primitives for CLI tools — currently just the
// shell-command spinner. Future home for any other shared
// rendering helpers (progress bars, colour palettes, prompts).
//
// Directory-as-module (g2eo.1): no `mod` declarations here. Sibling
// `.av` files in this directory auto-load via the resolver's flat
// namespace path; their exports surface at `@std.cli.ui.{...}`
// rather than the legacy `@std.cli.ui.spinner.{...}` form.
